#
msgid ""
msgstr "Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\n"

msgid "Add Rule"
msgstr "Tambah Peraturan"

msgid ""
"Add rules to define which profile and entity the user will receive based on "
"their email domain (Optional)."
msgstr ""
"Tambahkan peraturan untuk menentukan profil dan entiti mana yang pengguna "
"akan terima berdasarkan domain e-mel mereka (Pilihan)."

msgid "Automatically create users on first login"
msgstr "Cipta pengguna secara automatik pada log masuk pertama"

msgid "Configuration updated."
msgstr "Konfigurasi telah dikemas kini."

msgid "Default Rule (Fallback)"
msgstr "Peraturan Lalai (Pelan Sandaran)"

msgid "Default entity (ELSE)"
msgstr "Entiti lalai (JIKA TIDAK)"

msgid "Default profile (ELSE)"
msgstr "Profil lalai (JIKA TIDAK)"

msgid "Domain (after @)"
msgstr "Domain (selepas @)"

msgid "Entity"
msgstr "Entiti"

msgid "Failed to create the user in GLPI."
msgstr "Gagal mencipta pengguna dalam GLPI."

msgid "Google SSO"
msgstr "SSO Google"

msgid "Google SSO — Configuration"
msgstr "Google SSO — Konfigurasi"

msgid "Google authentication failed: %s"
msgstr "Pengesahan Google gagal: %s"

msgid "Google login cancelled: %s"
msgstr "Log masuk Google dibatalkan: %s"

msgid "Google response without authorization code."
msgstr "Respons Google tanpa kod pengesahan."

msgid ""
"If the user email does not match any of the rules above, this profile and "
"entity will be used. Mandatory if automatic creation is enabled."
msgstr ""
"Jika e-mel pengguna tidak sepadan dengan mana-mana peraturan di atas, profil"
" dan entiti ini akan digunakan. Wajib jika penciptaan automatik didayakan."

msgid "Invalid OAuth2 state. Try again from the login page."
msgstr "Keadaan OAuth2 tidak sah. Cuba lagi dari halaman log masuk."

msgid "Leave blank to keep current secret (stored encrypted)."
msgstr ""
"Biarkan kosong untuk mengekalkan rahsia semasa (disimpan secara tersulit)."

msgid "No GLPI user corresponds to this Google account."
msgstr "Tiada pengguna GLPI yang sepadan dengan akaun Google ini."

msgid "Only accounts from the %s domain are accepted."
msgstr "Hanya akaun daripada domain %s diterima."

msgid "Profile"
msgstr "Profil"

msgid "Profile and Entity Rules by Domain"
msgstr "Peraturan Profil dan Entiti mengikut Domain"

msgid "Register this Redirect URI in Google Cloud Console:"
msgstr "Daftarkan URI Pengalihan ini dalam Google Cloud Console:"

msgid "Restrict to domain (optional)"
msgstr "Hadkan kepada domain (pilihan)"

msgid "Save"
msgstr "Simpan"

msgid "Select..."
msgstr "Pilih..."

msgid "Session not initialized: user has no enabled profile."
msgstr "Sesi tidak dimulakan: pengguna tiada profil yang diaktifkan."

msgid "Sign in with Google"
msgstr "Log masuk dengan Google"

msgid "The Google account does not have a verified email."
msgstr "Akaun Google tidak mempunyai e-mel yang disahkan."

msgid "This user is deactivated in GLPI."
msgstr "Pengguna ini telah dinyahaktifkan dalam GLPI."

msgid "or"
msgstr "atau"

msgid ""
"Leave the option <strong>\"Remove domain of logins in form "
"login@domain\"</strong> as <strong>No</strong>. If enabled, users with the "
"same prefix in different providers (e.g., admin@gmail.com and "
"admin@institution.edu.br) will suffer account overlap."
msgstr ""
"Biarkan pilihan <strong>\"Alih keluar domain log masuk dalam borang log "
"masuk@domain\"</strong> sebagai <strong>Tidak</strong>. Jika didayakan, "
"pengguna dengan awalan yang sama dalam pembekal yang berbeza (cth., "
"admin@gmail.com dan admin@institution.edu.br) akan mengalami pertindihan "
"akaun."

msgid ""
"Check the <strong>Activate \"Sign in with Google\" button</strong> option "
"below and click <strong>Save</strong>."
msgstr ""
"Semak pilihan <strong>Aktifkan butang \"Log masuk dengan Google\"</strong> "
"di bawah dan klik <strong>Simpan</strong>."

msgid ""
"Change the <strong>Automatically add users from an external authentication "
"source</strong> field to <strong>Yes</strong>."
msgstr ""
"Tukar medan <strong>Tambah pengguna secara automatik daripada sumber "
"pengesahan luaran</strong> kepada <strong>Ya</strong>."

msgid "Step 1: Google Cloud Preparation"
msgstr "Langkah 1: Penyediaan Awan Google"

msgid "Critical Warning:"
msgstr "Amaran Kritikal:"

msgid "How to enable Google SSO integration?"
msgstr "Bagaimana untuk mendayakan penyepaduan SSO Google?"

msgid ""
"Google will generate a <strong>Client ID</strong> and a <strong>Client "
"Secret</strong>. Fill in the fields in this form with those keys."
msgstr ""
"Google akan menjana <strong>ID Pelanggan</strong> dan <strong>Rahsia "
"Pelanggan</strong>. Isikan medan dalam borang ini dengan kunci tersebut."

msgid ""
"Access the <a href=\"https://console.cloud.google.com/\" "
"target=\"_blank\">Google Cloud Console</a> and create a new "
"<strong>Project</strong>."
msgstr ""
"Akses <a href=\"https://console.cloud.google.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Google"
" Cloud Console</a> dan buat <strong>Projek</strong> baharu."

msgid "Redirect URI:"
msgstr "Ubah hala URI:"

msgid "Activate \"Sign in with Google\" button"
msgstr "Aktifkan butang \"Log masuk dengan Google\"."

msgid ""
"Then go to <strong>Credentials &gt; Create Credentials &gt; OAuth client "
"ID</strong>, choosing the <strong>Web application</strong> type."
msgstr ""
"Kemudian pergi ke <strong>Kelayakan &gt; Buat Bukti kelayakan &gt; ID klien "
"OAuth</strong>, memilih jenis <strong>Aplikasi web</strong>."

msgid "Step 2: GLPI Authentication Preparation"
msgstr "Langkah 2: Penyediaan Pengesahan GLPI"

msgid ""
"Go to <strong>APIs &amp; Services &gt; OAuth consent screen</strong> and "
"configure your app (add the scopes <code>email</code>, <code>profile</code>,"
" and <code>openid</code>)."
msgstr ""
"Pergi ke <strong>API &amp; Perkhidmatan &gt; Skrin persetujuan "
"OAuth</strong> dan konfigurasikan apl anda (tambahkan skop "
"<code>e-mel</code>, <code>profil</code> dan <code>openid</code>)."

msgid "In GLPI, go to <strong>Setup &gt; Authentication &gt; Setup</strong>."
msgstr ""
"Dalam GLPI, pergi ke <strong>Persediaan &gt; Pengesahan &gt; "
"Persediaan</strong>."

msgid ""
"Under <strong>Authorized redirect URIs</strong>, copy and paste exactly the "
"return URL below:"
msgstr ""
"Di bawah <strong>URI ubah hala yang dibenarkan</strong>, salin dan tampal "
"dengan tepat URL pulangan di bawah:"

msgid ""
"Subdomains are also accepted. E.g.: \"company.com\" will allow "
"user@company.com and user@sub.company.com."
msgstr ""
"Subdomain juga diterima. Cth.: \"company.com\" akan membenarkan "
"user@company.com dan user@sub.company.com."

msgid ""
"To test the account creation rules and discover which Profile/Entity will be"
" assigned to an email,"
msgstr ""
"Untuk menguji peraturan penciptaan akaun dan mengetahui Profil/Entiti yang "
"akan diberikan kepada e-mel,"

msgid ""
"The plugin calls <code>Session::init()</code>. The GLPI core loads the "
"user\\'s profiles and starts the session. The user is redirected to the "
"dashboard."
msgstr ""
"Pemalam memanggil <code>Session::init()</code>. Teras GLPI memuatkan profil "
"pengguna dan memulakan sesi. Pengguna dialihkan ke papan pemuka."

msgid "Error Creating Account"
msgstr "Ralat Mencipta Akaun"

msgid "No Profile Configured"
msgstr "Tiada Profil Dikonfigurasikan"

msgid "Database Search"
msgstr "Carian Pangkalan Data"

msgid "Do you wish to proceed and create your account now?"
msgstr "Adakah anda ingin meneruskan dan membuat akaun anda sekarang?"

msgid "click here"
msgstr "klik sini"

msgid "Auto Creation Disabled"
msgstr "Penciptaan Auto Dilumpuhkan"

msgid "Rules Simulator"
msgstr "Simulator Peraturan"

msgid ""
"The system would log into the existing account <strong>%s</strong> (ID: %d)."
" No new account would be created."
msgstr ""
"Sistem akan log masuk ke akaun sedia ada <strong>%s</strong> (ID: %d). Tiada"
" akaun baharu akan dibuat."

msgid "▶️ Simulate Login"
msgstr "▶️ Simulasi Log Masuk"

msgid ""
"Extracted domain: <strong>@%s</strong>. Applied rule: <strong>%s</strong>"
msgstr ""
"Domain yang diekstrak: <strong>@%s</strong>. Peraturan yang digunakan: "
"<strong>%s</strong>"

msgid "Configuration Read"
msgstr "Baca Konfigurasi"

msgid "User \"%s\" already exists. Login would be performed successfully."
msgstr "Pengguna \"%s\" sudah wujud. Log masuk akan berjaya dilakukan."

msgid ""
"The email domain \"<strong>%s</strong>\" is not allowed. The plugin "
"restricts access to the domain \"<strong>%s</strong>\" or its subdomains."
msgstr ""
"Domain e-mel \"<strong>%s</strong>\" tidak dibenarkan. Pemalam mengehadkan "
"akses kepada domain \"<strong>%s</strong>\" atau subdomainnya."

msgid ""
"The plugin calls <code>User::add()</code> to create the user "
"\"<strong>%s</strong>\"."
msgstr ""
"Pemalam memanggil <code>User::add()</code> untuk mencipta pengguna "
"\"<strong>%s</strong>\"."

msgid "using the primary email:"
msgstr "menggunakan e-mel utama:"

msgid "User::add() called"
msgstr "Pengguna::tambah() dipanggil"

msgid "Profile Determined by Plugin"
msgstr "Profil Ditentukan oleh Plugin"

msgid ""
"Profile: <strong>%s</strong> (ID: %d) | Entity: <strong>%s</strong> (ID: %d)"
msgstr ""
"Profil: <strong>%s</strong> (ID: %d) | Entiti: <strong>%s</strong> (ID: %d)"

msgid ""
"The email domain \"<strong>%s</strong>\" is allowed by the restriction rule."
msgstr "Domain e-mel \"<strong>%s</strong>\" dibenarkan oleh peraturan sekatan."

msgid "Core Default Profile Assigned"
msgstr "Profil Lalai Teras Ditugaskan"

msgid "Verified email present: <strong>%s</strong>"
msgstr "E-mel yang disahkan hadir: <strong>%s</strong>"

msgid "The user \"%s\" DOES NOT exist and auto-creation is disabled."
msgstr "Pengguna \"%s\" TIDAK wujud dan penciptaan automatik dilumpuhkan."

msgid "Profile Correction by Plugin"
msgstr "Pembetulan Profil melalui Pemalam"

msgid "Yes"
msgstr "ya"

msgid "To access the system via Google, a new account will be created for"
msgstr "Untuk mengakses sistem melalui Google, akaun baharu akan dibuat untuk"

msgid "Rule Used"
msgstr "Peraturan Digunakan"

msgid "Plugin googlesso step"
msgstr "Pasangkan langkah googlesso"

msgid "Simulator:"
msgstr "Simulator:"

msgid "Account Creation Required"
msgstr "Pembuatan Akaun Diperlukan"

msgid "Domain Rule for \"%s\""
msgstr "Peraturan Domain untuk \"%s\""

msgid ""
"This simulator faithfully reproduces the entire execution chain — from the "
"plugin logic to the internal GLPI Core behavior. Enter an email and see "
"step-by-step what would happen in a real login."
msgstr ""
"Simulator ini menghasilkan semula keseluruhan rantaian pelaksanaan dengan "
"setia — daripada logik pemalam kepada gelagat Teras GLPI dalaman. Masukkan "
"e-mel dan lihat langkah demi langkah perkara yang akan berlaku dalam log "
"masuk sebenar."

msgid "Back to configuration"
msgstr "Kembali ke konfigurasi"

msgid "Account Creation Confirmation"
msgstr "Pengesahan Pembuatan Akaun"

msgid "Domain Rules"
msgstr "Peraturan Domain"

msgid "Account Creation Simulator"
msgstr "Simulator Penciptaan Akaun"

msgid "No"
msgstr "Tidak"

msgid "No user found with the email <strong>%s</strong>"
msgstr "Tiada pengguna ditemui dengan e-mel <strong>%s</strong>"

msgid "Login / Email"
msgstr "Log masuk / E-mel"

msgid ""
"The \"Automatically create users\" configuration is "
"<strong>DISABLED</strong>. The login would be blocked."
msgstr ""
"Konfigurasi \"Buat pengguna secara automatik\" adalah "
"<strong>DIHIDUPKAN</strong>. Log masuk akan disekat."

msgid "(none)"
msgstr "(tiada)"

msgid "Login blocked: Only accounts from the %s domain are accepted."
msgstr "Log masuk disekat: Hanya akaun daripada domain %s diterima."

msgid "The user \"%s\" would be created successfully."
msgstr "Pengguna \"%s\" akan berjaya dibuat."

msgid ""
"The plugin removes the incorrect profiles assigned by GLPI and explicitly "
"links the profile <strong>%s</strong> and entity <strong>%s</strong> using "
"the <code>Profile_User</code> class."
msgstr ""
"Pemalam mengalih keluar profil yang salah yang diberikan oleh GLPI dan "
"memautkan profil <strong>%s</strong> dan entiti <strong>%s</strong> secara "
"eksplisit menggunakan kelas <code>Profile_User</code>."

msgid "Email Validation"
msgstr "Pengesahan E-mel"

msgid "User found by email: <strong>%s</strong> (ID: %d)"
msgstr "Pengguna ditemui melalui e-mel: <strong>%s</strong> (ID: %d)"

msgid "Domain Restriction Check"
msgstr "Semakan Sekatan Domain"

msgid "None"
msgstr "tiada"

msgid "Session::init() — Login Performed"
msgstr "Session::init() — Log Masuk Dilakukan"

msgid "Execution Chain (Step-by-Step)"
msgstr "Rantaian Pelaksanaan (Langkah demi Langkah)"

msgid "Login to Existing Account"
msgstr "Log masuk ke Akaun Sedia Ada"

msgid "How it works:"
msgstr "Cara ia berfungsi:"

msgid ""
"In GLPI 11, the core ignores the profile passed by external authentications "
"and automatically assigns the global default profile (usually Self-Service) "
"to the new user."
msgstr ""
"Dalam GLPI 11, teras mengabaikan profil yang diluluskan oleh pengesahan "
"luaran dan secara automatik menyerahkan profil lalai global (biasanya Layan "
"Diri) kepada pengguna baharu."

msgid "Final Entity"
msgstr "Entiti Akhir"

msgid "Final Result"
msgstr "Keputusan Akhir"

msgid "Back to Login"
msgstr "Kembali ke Log Masuk"

msgid "Simulated Email:"
msgstr "E-mel simulasi:"

msgid ""
"Restrict domain: <strong>%s</strong> | Auto create users: "
"<strong>%s</strong>"
msgstr ""
"Hadkan domain: <strong>%s</strong> | Auto buat pengguna: <strong>%s</strong>"

msgid "Final Profile"
msgstr "Profil Akhir"

msgid ""
"The user \"%s\" would be created, but without ANY profile. Access to GLPI "
"would be denied. Please configure a valid profile in the Default Rule or "
"Domain Rules."
msgstr ""
"Pengguna \"%s\" akan dibuat, tetapi tanpa SEBARANG profil. Akses kepada GLPI"
" akan dinafikan. Sila konfigurasikan profil yang sah dalam Peraturan Lalai "
"atau Peraturan Domain."

msgid "GLPI Core step"
msgstr "Langkah Teras GLPI"

msgid ""
"No valid profile (ID > 0) was found in the plugin rules. The user would be "
"created WITHOUT a profile."
msgstr ""
"Tiada profil yang sah (ID > 0) ditemui dalam peraturan pemalam. Pengguna "
"akan dibuat TANPA profil."
